Spec: Route row stats

Purpose:
  What one row of the History comparison sheet shows.

Owns:
  ./route_row_stats.dart
  /test/domain/route_row_stats_test.dart

References:
  /docs/specs/history/20-followed-rides.md

Must:
  A follow with coverage and route time shows its route part: route length times coverage, capped at the ride
    distance, its time on the route and the average over those.
  The rest of the ride shows as an off-route hint from `100` m on.
  The original, or an older follow without those values, shows the whole ride.
